# KMP Layer, Lint & ABI Rules

- Consult `agents/owners/<module>-owner.md` before changing any module under `kmp/`.
- Use `libs.versions.toml` / `internal.versions.toml` for every dependency; never hardcode versions.
- Keep `kmp/core` and `kmp/network` Apple CInterop bit-width-varying calls (`NSInteger`, `NSUInteger`, `CFIndex`) isolated in `apple64Main` + `watchosArm64Main` so `compileAppleMainKotlinMetadata` and `dokkaGenerateHtml` succeed.
- Enforce Spotless (`ktlint`), Detekt (`MaxLineLength <= 120`, `ReturnCount <= 2`, `CyclomaticComplexMethod <= 14`, `LongMethod <= 60`, `TooManyFunctions <= 11`), and BCV `apiCheck` (`apiDump` on intentional public API edits).
